"Arjun Thomas is an S-rank Brute, almost purely focused on physical strength."
"He has black hair and a sculpted beard and wears a dark blue armored bodysuit with a chest sigil."
"He was Hannah Elber's hero partner, the pair hired by Illinois to work in Chicago."
"He tackled Body Drainer through a building and across the street into the Thorns' apartment."
"Officially Richard and Leah Thorn died when he came through their wall."
"He killed Body Drainer in Alden Thorn's bedroom, tearing him nearly in half with his bare hands."
"Afterward he wept and shook; killing a civilian was his biggest fear."
"Months later he made one awkward video call to Alden from Alden's therapist's office."
"Illinois let him and Hannah go when their contracts came up after the Body Drainer incident."
"At Hannah's funeral he was stoic, at the back."
"Hannah called him a respected and trusted friend, but the two rarely talked."
"As a CNH alumni evaluator he voted no on Alden, a vote ruled inadmissible."
"He says he is not well-connected anymore, by choice."
"He warned Alden not to let people push him into things."
